    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A",
        "text": "*Pant* *pant*... Impressive!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B",
        "text": "The black raincoats are retreating! Run while you can!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "Thanks!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B",
        "text": "Don't thank us. If you have the strength, you should fight alongside us!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A",
        "text": "Did you see him swing down from the fourth floor and graze my head like that? If I didn't freeze his weapon with the Originium FrostNova left in my backpack, I wouldn't be standing here!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A",
        "text": "Very impressive. They're just like the swordsmen in the gas masks back in Ursus. Even stronger, really!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B",
        "text": "You almost died, what are you so excited about? The masked swordsmen you're talking about were the Ursus Royal Guard! We only met five of them that time!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B",
        "text": "Did you count how many raincoats there are?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A",
        "text": "Does that mean we're even more awesome than before?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B",
        "text": "This is not a time for jokes. Their techniques and their equipment mean they must have a city... Even the craftsmen of multiple cities supplying them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B",
        "text": "There's no way we can beat them back on our own. Don't even think about trying to kill them!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A",
        "text": "I just... I just think I did pretty well."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B",
        "text": "The point is this situation is way beyond what we can handle... We can't hold out for long!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C",
        "text": "Quiet!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Reporting in."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C",
        "text": "Sister, these are... Faust's people."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "*Cough* *cough*... I recognize them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_016",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "FrostNova, we received your message, and..."
