    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "What's going on?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "We... we found some locals locked up in here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "A mother and daughter. We were going to use the place as a firing position, but we don't know how to communicate with them... They seem pretty scared of us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lungmenite",
        "text": "(Local language)!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lungmenite",
        "text": "(Local language) ...... (local language) ......!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#8"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "She is your child, yes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Child",
        "text": "Waaahhh!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#8"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Such a healthy one."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Don't be afraid. Don't cry. Your mama is right here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Mama is here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Child",
        "text": "Waaahhh..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Child",
        "text": "Mm... Um... Mm."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Child",
        "text": "Hehe."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "Oh, the child is smiling..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Get her out of here."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lungmenite",
        "text": "...... (Local language)?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "You *cough* escort her. See her to safety."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "They're uninfected. There are so many of our people who need evacuating. We don't have time."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Oh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "...Right. Who cares whether it's the Infected or the uninfected now? Understood."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "Erm, uh, ma'am, um... Komm zis way?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lungmenite",
        "text": "Neidei, neidei... hou."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "FrostNova, Sister, wait for us to come back. Don't try to hold on your own."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Have some faith in your big sister."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#9"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Hurry! They're coming!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "They are deploying some units wearing other uniforms... They might be Lungmen's L. G. D.!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "*Cough* *cough* ... *hack*."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Go!"
    },
